Turn on statuscolors and run whenever your HP is red (whenever it's
yellow to be extra careful). If you have a buff pet, lock it behind
the door and let it attempt to clear Ludios. Since enemies only attack
a pet in self-defense, a pet is effectively never surrounded. In the
best case, a purple worm can trivially clear Ludios, and almost
trivially clear the castle.

