Price-id all your potions in a general store. And most especially, if
a monster has  a potion that costs 100 (or especially 200) zm in
inventory #name it and drink it within a locked shop. The worst cases
are confusion or sleeping at 100 zm, or polymorph at 200 zm, so take
your armor off for 200 zm potions.


